Input: {"question": "Who is the artist of the album \"Crazy World\"?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d00", "start": 0, "end": 116, "text": "Crazy World (Boys Like Girls album) Crazy World is the third studio album by American pop rock band Boys Like Girls."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d00", "start": 117, "end": 273, "text": "The \"Crazy World\" EP was released on 17 July 2012 with the tracks, \"Be Your Everything\", \"Life of the Party\" and \"The First Time\" to help promote the album."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d00", "start": 274, "end": 318, "text": "The album was released on December 11, 2012."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d00", "start": 319, "end": 466, "text": "On November 15, they posted a \"Crazy World Song Reveal\" page, allowing fans to share a link to it in order to unlock a new song off the new record."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d00", "start": 467, "end": 526, "text": "On November 16, the new track was revealed as \"Stuck in the"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01", "start": 0, "end": 52, "text": "Boys Like Girls stream \"Be Your Everything\" preview."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01", "start": 53, "end": 71, "text": "Alternative Press."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01", "start": 72, "end": 85, "text": "July 9, 2012."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01", "start": 86, "end": 111, "text": "Retrieved March 13, 2025."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01", "start": 112, "end": 145, "text": "^ Johan Wippsson (July 15, 2012)."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01", "start": 146, "end": 208, "tex